 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 526671,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A factory can mill 300 cubic meters of flour each day. They package the flour in boxes that measure <span data-math=\"20\\,{\\text{cm}} \\times 5\\,{\\text{cm}} \\times 30\\,{\\text{cm}}\">20\\,{\\text{cm}} \\times 5\\,{\\text{cm}} \\times 30\\,{\\text{cm}}</span>. How many boxes of flour does the factory produce each day?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Convert the dimensions of the box to meters.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"20\\cancel{{{\\text{centimeters}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{{\\text{1 meter}}}}{{100{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{\\text{centimeters}}}}}}} \\right) = 0.2{\\text{ meter}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"5\\cancel{{{\\text{centimeters}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{{\\text{1 meter}}}}{{100{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{\\text{centimeters}}}}}}} \\right) = 0.05{\\text{ meter}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"30\\cancel{{{\\text{centimeters}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{{\\text{1 meter}}}}{{100{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{\\text{centimeters}}}}}}} \\right) = 0.3{\\text{ meter}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 2: Find the volume of one box.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"V{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}L{\\text{ }} \\times {\\text{ }}W \\times H{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}\\left( {{\\text{0}}{\\text{.2 m}}} \\right)\\left( {{\\text{0}}{\\text{.05 m}}} \\right)\\left( {0.3{\\text{ m}}} \\right){\\text{ }} = 0.003{\\text{ }}{{\\text{m}}^3}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 3: Divide the flour milled by the volume of a box to find the number of boxes produced each day.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"300{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{{\\text{m}}^3}}}\\left( {\\frac{{{\\text{1 box}}}}{{0.003{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{{\\text{m}}^3}}}{\\text{ }}}}} \\right) = 100,000{\\text{ boxes}}\"></span></p>\n<p>The factory can produce 100,000 boxes per day.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "100,000 boxes"
    }
   ],
